{%- comment -%}
  SBS US market launch — shared privacy notice for forms that collect personal data.

  Renders the approved wording with a locale-aware Privacy Policy link that always
  stays inside the active market. Deliberately renders no checkbox and no marketing
  consent control: responding to a quote request must not require consent capture,
  and no marketing subscription may be implied.

  Usage: render the snippet 'sbs-privacy-notice' inside the form, above the submit control.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  if routes.root_url == '/'
    assign sbs_pn_root = ''
  else
    assign sbs_pn_root = routes.root_url
  endif
  assign sbs_pn_url = sbs_pn_root | append: '/policies/privacy-policy'
-%}
<p class="sbs-privacy-notice" data-sbs-privacy-notice style="font-size:0.85em;line-height:1.45;margin:0.75em 0;">
  We&rsquo;ll use the information you provide to respond to your request.
  See our <a class="sbs-privacy-notice__link" href="{{ sbs_pn_url }}">Privacy Policy</a>.
</p>
